  "notes": [
    "All 29 unit cards and six spells manually transcribed. Conditional Armor(3) granted by default shield equipment and removed on replacement only when the PDF names the shield in the replacement.",
    "Two novice specialist slots, free Pistoleer sergeant, independent Blessed Titan arms, conditional Battle Rifle attachments.",
    "Procession Altar statue replaces the original weapon and buff together. Constance backpack replaces individual range with aura.",
    "Protector Sisters retain shields on sword-only replacements as stated in source. One-model upgrade representative slots and original-weapon branch restrictions need New Recruit verification.",
    "Armor(2), Armor(3) and Anti-Cover use established definitions. Shred in Melee inferred directly from corresponding aura wording.",
    "Mount Tough and Altar Tough/Transport aggregation require ForceOrg tests.",
    "No other faction or exporter changed."
  ]
